@startuml SetGoal_Sequence
title RubyGYM - Set Training Goal (Member-owned)

actor Member
actor Trainer
participant "Frontend" as FE
participant "Backend" as BE
database "MySQL" as DB

== Member sets/updates own goal ==
Member -> FE: Open Goals page, fill goal form
FE -> BE: PUT /api/goals/me\n{goal_type, target_weight, target_bmi, target_date, notes}
BE -> BE: Authorize role == MEMBER (own member only)
BE -> DB: INSERT ... ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE training_goals\n(UNIQUE member_id)
DB --> BE: ok
BE --> FE: 200 {goal saved}
FE --> Member: Show "Đã lưu mục tiêu"

== Trainer reads goal (read-only) ==
Trainer -> FE: Open monthly evaluation for a client
FE -> BE: GET /api/goals/member/:memberId
BE -> BE: Authorize: Trainer owns this member
alt Trainer is owner or Admin
  BE -> DB: SELECT training_goals WHERE member_id
  DB --> BE: goal
  BE --> FE: 200 {goal} (read-only)
else not owner
  BE --> FE: 403 Access denied
end
note over BE
ADR-001: Trainer/Admin cannot modify a member's goal.
PUT /api/goals/member/:id is rejected for non-member roles.
end note
@enduml
